      en: ["The beach is located on the northwestern tip of Praslin Island.", "Land access usually requires prior permission from the resort.", "There is no offshore reef, leading to deeper coastal waters.", "The bay spans approximately 250 meters in length.", "It is bordered by iconic granite boulders at both ends.", "Anse Georgette consistently ranks among the world's best beaches."],
